{"unit_id":"GoldenLoaf24h__dsh-prompt-suggestion#card-zh","repo":"GoldenLoaf24h/dsh-prompt-suggestion","commit":"79119de2e6cfa762dff1eb9c570c8f7b3d995b7f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestion 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的下一条提示预测插件。它在每轮对话结束后读取近期用户与助手文本，通过 DSH 当前或设置中选择的模型生成简短建议，并将建议显示为输入框中的灰色 ghost text。用户可用 Tab 采纳、Alt+右方向键逐词采纳、Enter 采纳并发送，也可按 Alt+R 获取不同建议；插件还支持历史提示补全、回填上一条提示、预测缓存和可配置的模型及生成参数。适合希望更快续写编码助手对话的 DSH 用户；需要可用的模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:579-624","lib/client.js:812-925"]}
{"unit_id":"GoldenLoaf24h__dsh-prompt-suggestion#card-en","repo":"GoldenLoaf24h/dsh-prompt-suggestion","commit":"79119de2e6cfa762dff1eb9c570c8f7b3d995b7f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-prompt-suggestion predicts the next prompt in the DSH web composer and displays it as ghost text. Tab accepts it, Alt+Right adds it word by word, Enter can accept and send, and Alt+R requests another. It also completes prompts from session history. Requires an available model route.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:579-624","lib/client.js:812-925"]}
